1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Detailed in Luft's book The Naturalized Jews of the Grand Duchy of Posen in 1834 ad 1835, Revised Edition, 2004.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is a Rabbi. He was naturalized on June 28, 1834 in the town of Ostrowo. This town lies in the area of Adelnau and   Raszkow. Not Pomerania. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Listed in the database of the Steinheim Institute list of Rabbis. Born in Lissa, died in Ostrowo, Wielkopolski.
