2 CONT * ^ Kuntres Pri Etz Hadar (Jerusalem תרל"ח)
2 CONT * ^ HaLevanon 13 no 42 Letter by Rabbi Meir Auerbach
2 CONT
2 CONT *Biography of Rabbi Meir Auerbach
