1 NAME Moshe /Okanovski ?/
2 GIVN Moshe
2 _MARNM Okanovski ?
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1789
1 OCCU Rosh Kahal Ozorkow
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born in a small town closed to Poznan.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ordained as a rabbi by Rabbi Akiva Eger, Rabbi Yaalov Lorberbaum of Lissa and Rabbi Chaim Auerbach of Lunshitz - also his father in law.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Served as Rosh Kehila (Community Leader) of the Jewish community of Ozorkow.
2 CONT
2 CONT Was one of the first Jewish inhabitants of Ozorkow where he set up a clothes factory.
2 CONT
2 CONT Was close to Rabbis Fischel of Strikow, Shmuel Abba of Zichlin and Meir Leibush (Malbim).
2 CONT
2 CONT  Source: Yizkor Book of Ozorkow  written by Yehuda Arie Leiv Levin
