2 CONT
2 CONT R' ZVI HIRSH VITESH WITELES (CHARIF) LANDAU (1643 - 1714) WAS MARRIED TWICE. HE WAS A DELEGATE TO THE COUNCIL OF THE FOUR LANDS. Witeles means charif which is the hebrew word for wise or sharp. HIS FIRST WIFE WAS BORN IN 1646 HILD
2 CONC ESHEIM, GERMANY AND WAS THE MOTHER OF R' YEHUDA (JUDAH) LANDAU. SHE WAS THE GRANDMOTHER OF THE NODA B'YEHUDA. Zvi Hirsh Vitesh Witeles (Charif) Landau was the son of Yechezkel Segal I Landi, and the father of Yehuda Landau.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT --------
