1 NAME R' Joseph Saul Nathanson, A.B.D. Lvov
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1808
2 ADDR
3 CITY Berezhany
3 STAE Ternopil's'ka oblast
3 CTRY Ukraine
