1 NOTE {geni:about_me} - Stammbaum der Familie Landsberg - cannot read his name due to poor photocopy
2 CONT
2 CONT G016
2 CONT
2 CONT Date: Mon, 12 Jul 1999 21:04:16 +0200
2 CONT
2 CONT Subject: WOW IS AN ENGLISH WORD MEANING GOSH AND GOLLY
2 CONT
2 CONT From: "Simon Srebrny" Srebrny@@csi.com
2 CONT
2 CONT Alfred Ludwig Wieruszowski
2 CONT
2 CONT b.Goerlitz 6 December 1857, d.Berlin 9 February 1945, buried Friedhof
2 CONT
2 CONT Weissensee Berlin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr juris et juris h. c.; Senatspräsident am Oberlandgericht, Professor an der Handelshochschule Koeln in 1928
2 CONT
2 CONT m. (1) Bonn 1890 Jenny Landsberg
2 CONT
2 CONT b.Stolberg 1866, d.??
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter of Elias Landsberg and Klara Bamberger
2 CONT
2 CONT m. (2) in ?? on ?? Frieda Bartdorff
2 CONT
2 CONT b. ??, d. ??
2 CONT
2 CONT Alfred Ludwig had four children - by which wife??
2 CONT
2 CONT Among them:
2 CONT
2 CONT C.1 Maria Wieruszowski
2 CONT
2 CONT b. ......, d. ......
2 CONT
2 CONT m. ...... Oppenheim
2 CONT
2 CONT b. ......, d. ......
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs Oppenheim was living in London when the tomb to her father was erected.
2 CONT
2 CONT C.2 Helene Wieruszowski
2 CONT
2 CONT b.Elberfeld 13 December 1893, d.New York ...... 1980
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr phil.; mediaeval historian
2 CONT
2 CONT See Biographisches Handbuch der deutschsprachigen Emigration.
2 CONT
2 CONT Helene Wieruszowski was living in Basel when the tomb to her father was erected. (Munich: Saur, 198..)
2 CONT
2 CONT C.3 Lilli Wieruszowski
2 CONT
2 CONT b.Cologne 10 December 1899
2 CONT
2 CONT Lilli Wieruszowski was living in Basel when the tomb to her father was
2 CONT
2 CONT erected.
2 CONT
2 CONT C.4 Ruth Wieruszowski
2 CONT
2 CONT b.Cologne-Lindenthal 31 October 1910
2 CONT
2 CONT m. ...... Pincus
2 CONT
2 CONT b. ......
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Pincus was living in Jerusalem when the tomb to her father was erected.
2 CONT
2 CONT G016 Amtsgerichtsrat in Siegen/Westfalen, son of
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel Wieruszowski and Helene Henschel, beide d. Goerlitz vor 1890.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wer ist's 1928: Alfred Ludwig Wieruszowski, b.Goerlitz 6 DEC 1857; P:
2 CONT
2 CONT Moritz, Kaufmann; M: geb. Henschel; m. 1) Jenny Landsberg; m. 2) Frieda Bartdorff; 4 Kinder; living in Köln.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jüdischer Friedhof, Berlin-Weissensee, tombstone inscription: (A 1 on path) (Nr.111552):
2 CONT
2 CONT Alfred Wieruszowski, 6 December 1857 - 9 February 1945
2 CONT
2 CONT Ihrem Vater / Maria Oppenheim, London / Helene W., NY / Lilli W., Basel / Ruth Pincus, Jerusalem
