2 CONT
2 CONT Shmuel Ha-Levi "Schmuel" Landau, 1756 - 1833
2 CONT Shmuel Ha-Levi Landau was born in 1756 to Ezekiel Landau and Liba Landau (born bat Yaakov of Brody) .
2 CONT Ezekiel was born on October 8 1713, in Opatów, Opatów County, Swietokrzyskie, Poland.
2 CONT Liba was born in 1720, in Dubno, Rivnens'ka oblast, Ukraine.
2 CONT Shmuel had 12 siblings: Frieda Landau , Ewa Elka Wehle (born Landau) and 10 other siblings .
2 CONT Shmuel married Hindsche Sara Landau (born Helman) in 1770, at age 14.
2 CONT Hindsche was born on October 25 1752, in Metz, Moselle, Lorraine, France.
2 CONT They had 8 children: Yarit Altshul (born Landau) , Abraham Jacob Landau and 6 other children .
2 CONT Shmuel then married Yita Landau (born Tabak) .
2 CONT Yita was born in 1780, in Prag.
2 CONT They had 3 sons: Shmuel (Alter Shmiel son of Shmuel) Landau and 2 other children .
2 CONT Shmuel then married <first name> Landau (born Braff (Brav)) circa 1840, at age 84.
2 CONT They had one son: Alexander Landau .
2 CONT Shmuel passed away in 1833, at age 77.
2 CONT
2 CONT --- // ---
2 CONT
2 CONT One of three brothers who moved to Austria-Hungary and changed their last name from Landau to Engelman.
