2 CONT Chana Tusk nee Perle was born in Lodz, Poland in 1891. She was married to Hercki. Prior to WWII she lived in Lodz, Poland. During the war she was in Warsaw, Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Chana was murdered in the Shoah.
2 CONT
2 CONT This information is based on a Page of Testimony (displayed here) submitted by her daughter, Natalia Tusk Obrebska
