1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -- from Stephen T. Falk: "Emanuel FALK was born in 1832.  His parents had had an earlier son in 1826 whom they named Emanuel.  He died at about 4 months old.  When my great grandfather was born 6 years later, he wa
2 CONC s called Mendel and Zecharia Mendel.  However, at some point, he came to be known as Emanuel."
2 CONT
2 CONT מגילות יחש של משפחת יפה- צבי יפה 1996/ גניגר ישראל- עמוד 7ג
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT I was born six years before a brother named Zecharyah Mendel who ended up being known as Emanuel.
