2 CONT She lived in Košice, Slovakia with her husband Martin, who was allegedly a journalist. She had 9 children (5 boys, 4 girls) and died because of an abortion with her 10th child in 1933
2 CONT
2 CONT She lived in Košice, Slovakia with her husband Martin, who was allegedly a journalist. She had 9 children (5 boys, 4 girls) and died because of an abortion with her 10th child in 1933. All of her sons and husband died during IIWW 
2 CONC except for the youngest son (his name was allegedly Tibi). All girls survived. Adela fled to Israel, Lili to Canada together with Tibi, Veronika fled to Canada in 1956, too, and Hedvika ended up in the then Czechoslovakia. I am de
2 CONC scendant of Hedvika. Unfortunatelly, she died long before I was even born but all the informations I have are from her sister Veronika who I met personally.
