1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hercki Tusk was born in Bełchatow, Poland in 1889 to Chaim and Mindel. He was married to Chana nee Perle. Prior to WWII he lived in Lodz, Poland. During the war he was in Varsha, Poland.
2 CONT
