1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Paula Wenke nee Rawicz was born in Breslau in 1896 to Sigmar and Olga. She was a teacher and divorced found in the Ernst. Prior to WWII she lived in Munich, Germany. During the war she was in Munich, Germany. Paula
2 CONC  perished in 1944 in Riga, Latvia.
2 CONT
