1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dr. Salo Kroch was born in Breslau in 14.4.1856 to Jacob and Berta nee Falk. He was married to Laura. Prior to WWII he lived in Dresden, Germany. During the war he was  in Praha, Czechoslovakia. He was deported wit
2 CONC h Transport AA from Praha to Terezin on 20/07/1942. Dr. Kroch perished in 1942 in Theresienstadt, Camp on 24/09/1942 at the age of 95.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.holocaust.cz/en/database-of-victims/victim/103266-salo-kroch/
2 CONT
2 CONT * Born 14. 04. 1856
2 CONT * Last residence before deportation: Prague XII
2 CONT * Address/place of registration in the Protectorate: Prague XII, Schwerinova 83
2 CONT * Transport AAs, no. 425 (20. 07. 1942, Prague -> Terezín)
2 CONT * Murdered 24. 09. 1942 Terezín
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.holocaust.cz/en/database-of-digitised-documents/document/83660-kroch-salo-death-certificate-ghetto-terezin/
