1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bruno Falk was born in 1881 in Breslau to Emanuel and Johanna. Prior to WWII he lived in Berlin, Germany. During the war he was in Berlin, Germany. He was deported with Transport from Berlin to Auschwitz on 01/03/1
