2 CONT The Mikulov (Mušlov) macejva from 1785 decorated with obligatory shells, volutes and also a distinctive sign in the sun disk or star belongs to the rav of Mosš Bondi, whose family came to Polná from Prague. Rav Bondi was a rabbi h
2 CONC ere.
