2 CONT G9.1 Rachel Reitze born in 1736 and died after 1790, married R. Saul, ABD Przedborz, son of Samuel, ABD Slonim, who succeeded R. Joshua Feiwel Teomim as ABD Przemysl in 1718 and where Samuel died about 1732.
2 CONT
2 CONT G10.1 R. (Jacob) Samuel Landau, of Cracow, married Reizel, born in 1736 and died after 1790, a descendant of R. Nathan Nata Spira, the ''Megaleh Amukot''.
2 CONT
2 CONT G11.2 '''R. Saul Rafael Landau of Cracow''', born in 1777 and died in 1854, married Feitche, born in 1775 and died in 1847, daughter of Shachna Horowitz and Malka Hinde.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source
2 CONT
2 CONT The Unbroken Chain - Neil Rosenstein (3rd Edition) Volume 3, Chapter 9, pages 748 and 750
2 CONT
