1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Again I thought the Hurwitz's had no half brothers or sisters.Instead there's buelah,harry,benzion,genevive,dr.leon nephatale,miriam.We found Miriam today on the west side of desplaines ave. at gate 17 which is dor
2 CONC sche tov cong.gate lot 63 section row 63 grave 2. This area of the cemetery is very densely populated with a lot of graves,surrounded by a forest preserve.In fact I had a mother deer and baby deer give me 2 minute stares til they 
2 CONC figured out to move along.As fortunately bella Brownstein is a few rows east of Miriam on kitty corner from each other.Also the area is filled with trees that have huge leaves that blow in circles or are flying around.Miriam today
2 CONC  was coated with a dense lichen algae green layered surround.I'm glad Miriam was rescued by me today as another winter Miriam would be totally coated with green algae.So the pics I show you today will be transforming!!!  Miriam st
2 CONC one says our darling her name her dates of living and dying.The stone is like a limey stone with black speckles and deep crevices or holes throughout the base.
