2 CONC abbi Betzalel Margolis ABD Ostroah, and there is a third opinion); the wife of Rabbi Naftali Herz Broda ABD Mikolinitz; the wife of Rabbi Khaim ABD Slopkowitz son of Reb Uri of Zolkiew; and there are those who say also the wife of
