1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Please note the following from Volume 3, 3rd edition of the Unbroken Chain, pages 357-358:
2 CONT
2 CONT The Elias Eliasberg of Pinsk who is G.14.3 is the 3rd child of Samuel Eisenberg of Minsk, died 1850, who was G.13.1.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel's brother, G13.2 was a Moses Haim Eliasberg, who married Roshke Eliasberg. Their 2nd child was the Isaah Eliasberg of Ivanets and Minsk who is the G14.2 Isaah that was described below in the GEDCOM notes.  
2 CONT
2 CONT The book indicates that G14.3 Elias Eliasberg was married to his niece (i.e. not his  first cousin) Zelda, who was a daughter of Moses of Luria.  Pages 357 and 358 have a number of different people who do have the same names, so c
2 CONC are should be taken not to merge these profiles together. ___________________________________________________________________________________________
2 CONT
