1 NOTE {geni:about_me} NOTE:  She has been disconnected from R' Zvi Hirsch Chajes, because she could not have been married to him.  She was married to Icek Kohn in 1837, and remained married to him until her death in 1889, which was subs
2 CONC equent to the death of R' Zvi Hirsch Chajes.  Her death certificate indicates that she was a widow of Icek Kohn.  She may have been confused with a different daughter of Samuel Berenstein who was married to R' Zvi Hirsch Chajes.
2 CONT
