1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1912
2 CONT Father was only fifty-three years old—in front of our eyes, a sturdy, healthy man, 
2 CONT filled with the joy of life, became a ruin. His illness made such an impression on me that 
2 CONT even now, in my dreams I only see him as ill and emaciated. It is as though all former 
2 CONT memories of him have been swept away. We tried to fool him about his condition, but as we 
2 CONT later learned, he’d known exactly how ill he was. A few days before his death he said, 
2 CONT “When it’s all over, call Dr. Eisenstadt and tell him,’Baruch dajan emet.’” (Dr. Eisenstadt 
2 CONT was later in the Gola Rabbi in Paris.) What sufferings one must have gone through to look, 
2 CONT at the age of fifty-three, into the eye of one’s fate! All of us four children surrounded 
2 CONT Father’s bed when, on the 4th of April, he breathed his last. 
2 CONT Father was buried the next day at the Povonskoer Cemetery. His funeral was 
2 CONT impressive. The day of the funeral, April 7th, was a sunny spring day, and an enormous 
2 CONT crowd of family friends and business associates accompanied him on his last road. On his 
2 CONT grave stands a beautiful monument—the work of Ginzburg, a gifted Jewish sculptor, a 
2 CONT Kopelman/MEMOIRS OF MAX KOPELMANN 65
2 CONT student of Antokolsky. Who knows if, after all St. Petersburg has had to endure, it is still 
2 CONT standing there.
2 CONT - Max Koppelman Memoirs
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT לשלמה וליוג'יני קופלמן נולדו 6 בנים ו-3 בנות.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage in Mogilev===
2 CONT
2 CONT Mogilev 
2 CONT Mogilev  Mogilev   ________________________________________5/8/1880  10 Elul 	KAPIN'MAN, Yosef Shleima  ________________________________________TSEYTLIN, Sheyndel	 Eliash/Esel  [groom father]
2 CONT
2 CONT ________________________________________Chaim Shabsai [bride father]
2 CONT   	22   ________________________________________20 		Kahan   ________________________________________Leib Fishman   ________________________________________Hirsh Leib Yermanetz 	Mogilev   ________________________________________18
2 CONC 80   ________________________________________M   ________________________________________M76 	1920801 /  
2 CONT
2 CONT NHAB/3362/3/1 
