1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Max Koppelman's memoirs:
2 CONT ==========
2 CONT After I was removed from the wet nurse’s breast, I came under the care of my Njanja, 
2 CONT Akulina Stepanowna Kutchenova, who was to stay with us for seven years. When my sisters 
2 CONT were born, Sonia in 1884 and Sasha, in 1885 she took care of them in turn. An amusing 
2 CONT detail: When Sasha’s birth was duly registered at the police station, it was discovered that 
2 CONT Sonia’s birth had never been properly recorded. The only remedy was to report the birth of 
2 CONT twins and so for many years the two of them went through school as twin sisters.
2 CONT =========
