1 NOTE {geni:about_me} YAD VA SHEM
2 CONT
2 CONT Muma Kopelman was born in Russia (USSR) in 1891 to Salomon and Sheindl. He was an agent and married to Wera nee Schor. During the war he was in Russia (USSR). Muma was murdered in Kowno, Lithuania. This information is based on a P
2 CONC age of Testimony (displayed on left) submitted by his brother. [Max Kopelmann].
