1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Wera Wolff was born in Moskva, Russia (USSR) in 1888 to Salomon and Eugenie. She was married. Prior to WWII she lived in Kowno, Lithuania. During the war she was in Kowno, Lithuania. Wera was murdered in 1940 in th
2 CONC e Shoah. This information is based on a Page of Testimony (displayed on left) submitted by her brother. [Max Meir Kopelman]. https://yvng.yadvashem.org/index.html?language=he&advancedSearch=true&sfn_value=%D7%9E%D7%90%D7%99%D7%A8&
