2 CONT Dov David died on 8 Tamuz TARMAD, several days after suffering heatstroke in his orange grove (and being treated for Malaria...). It was only few months after his arrival to Erez Israel with his family.
2 CONT
2 CONT With the establishment of the first Jewish Orange Grove in Israel, he and Sara Itta are credited in many Israeli history books.  
2 CONT
2 CONT (See 1883)
