1 NOTE {geni:about_me} It would not be reasonable to not let everyone know how incredibly kind Hannah was.When I was but 4 years old, despite not being well herself she parked herself at my bedside at the hospital and spent several night
2 CONC s and days constantly putting calamine lotion on me as I was covered with poison ivy,poison oak and poison summa {as that was the treatment at the time) ,reading and singing to me, as  I screamed away because my arms and legs were
2 CONC  strapped to the bedposts.All these years later and I have never forgotten it. And,I was just her niece. Just one of my wonderful remembers of her.  Barbaraellen Harris Smoller (Harris)
