1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Shifrah Shatan was born in Konstantynów, Poland in 1920 to Avram Elya and Touba. She was single. Prior to WWII she lived in Konstantynów, Poland. During the war she was in Konstantynów, Poland.
2 CONT
