1 CONC ok, she was able to find the grave site:  Plot E, Section 3, Lot 5, Grave 7.  After going to Colma, I called Sinai Memorial Chapel to find out which Jewish cemetery Lina is in.  It is 'Hills of Eternity".  I visited the cemetery a
1 CONC nd found the grave that same day (2-16-96).  I took several photographs.
1 CONT
